{
  "schema": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "DNS factor-isolation suite. Every dns_sub_*/dns_iso_*/dns_div_* fixture PRODUCES",
    "DELIBERATELY WRONG SCORES; dns_sched_* and the chunk fixtures are bit-exact.",
    "No case here references tests/golden/ and none may ever be added to one.",
    "ctl-a/ctl-b are a byte-identical pair and MUST read 1.000x +/- 0.5%. If they do",
    "not, register allocation is not controlled and no other ratio in the run is",
    "readable -- that failure mode invalidated an entire previous run.",
    "On NVIDIA the build applies -cl-nv-maxrregcount=128 automatically, so every case",
    "is register-pinned without passing args.",
    "Counts are 8x the rtx5080 launch width (43008 lanes)."
  ],
